  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refined-storage\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此模組需要精緻儲存（Refined Storage）</span></span></strong></span></a></span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">如果你想將此模組加入你的模組包，歡迎使用 :)</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">此模組僅新增一個通用網格</span><span style=\"color:#000\">。</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></span></span></p><h4><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1112/839/recipe.png\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></h4><p>&nbsp;<br>可切換模式：</p><p>1.21.1 或以上版本：</p><ul>\n<li>網格</li>\n<li>合成網格</li>\n<li>自動合成監視器</li>\n</ul><p>1.20.1 或以下版本：</p><ul>\n<li>網格</li>\n<li>合成網格</li>\n<li>流體網格</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/WpUmcmUayN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/40115388/ec29dadf15db1421b9984cc1234b28314f448a34.png\" width=\"381\" height=\"144\"></a></p>",
